// A concept line with one word said twice in a row is still that concept.
// The exact line stays. A partial line stays partial.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE twice ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG twice law

IMPULSE twice 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "twice" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
